example: {"c":"Actions","items":[{"icon":"drop","label":"Water","goto":"water"},{"icon":"plus","label":"Add plant","goto":"add_plant"},{"icon":"calendar","label":"Schedule","goto":"schedule"}]}

Amount:
Amount: One sum of money written properly, with its period, old price or change.
props: { density?: comfortable|compact, emphasis?: normal|hero="normal", surface?: card|outlined="card", detail?: full|brief="full", style?: inline|total, label?: text≤24, value: number, currency?: USD|EUR|GBP|JPY|CNY|INR|AUD|CAD|CHF|SEK|NOK|DKK|PLN|CZK|HUF|MXN|BRL|ZAR|KRW|TRY|NZD="USD", per?: none|hour|day|night|week|month|year|each|person="none", was?: number, change?: number, changeIn?: money|percent="money", sub?: text≤40, goto?: id snake_case }
Rule: Use JSON null for every unrequested Amount axis, not its default string. Never write comfortable, normal, or card just because they are defaults.
Rule: If asked only to hide the secondary note, use detail "brief" and keep sub; density, emphasis, and surface must be null.
Rule: For one large focal figure, use emphasis hero and leave surface null. Only a separate request for an outline sets surface outlined. Use style total only for a total with the automatic label.
example: {"c":"Amount","emphasis":null,"label":"Spent on plants","value":42.5,"change":-6.5,"sub":"this month"}

Banner:
Banner: Something important to notice now, with an optional link to act.
